  "How do I set up VPN and required software?": {
    "messages": [
      {
        "author": "GLEAN_AI",
        "messageType": "UPDATE",
        "fragments": [{ "text": "Searching company knowledge" }]
      },
      {
        "author": "GLEAN_AI",
        "messageType": "CONTENT",
        "fragments": [
          {
            "text": "Install the Sample Corp VPN client from the IT portal's software catalog. Log in with SSO; MFA is required on first connection per device. Split-tunneling is on by default, so only internal-network traffic (portal.sample.internal, internal APIs, and internal Git) routes through the VPN."
          },
